# The hand-off windows' bound is dropped, so the environment opens windows past the
# instance's bound. The bound stands for the model's finite instance; the mutation
# checks that it is real.
MODULE: TypeOkForeignWindowPastBound
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a hand-off window opens past MaxWindows
PERTURBS: ForeignOpen

--- FIND
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ windows < MaxWindows
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~hoOpen
\* MUTATION: no bound on the windows.
--- END
